he year about shiny  and production and doing DevOps as a  data scientist they're all available on  speaker debt and like Jared mentioned  I'm really trying to get that rad bins  hashtag going I'm part of a big team at  our studio that does solutions  engineering and we all write content  that lives at solutions dot our studio  comm and if you're looking to get in  touch with us community our studio comm  and the rad men's channel there is a  way to do that thank you  [Applause]
 

